      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "KindredPassiveManager",
        "name": "Mark of the Kindred",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Kindred can mark targets to Hunt. Successfully completing a Hunt permanently empowers Kindred's basic abilities. Every 4 hunts completed also increases Kindred's basic attack range.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Mark of the Kindred</span><span><span style=\"color: #FF9900\">Lamb</span> can choose a champion to <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">hunt</span> by clicking the champion portraits above the inventory.<font size = '4'><br /><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: #FF9900\">Wolf</span> periodically hungers for and <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">hunts</span> <span style=\"color: #FF9999\">enemy</span> jungle monsters. <br /><br />Each kill or assist on hunted targets completes a hunt and empowers Kindred's basic abilities. The first ? successful hunts increase Kindred's attack range by ?. Every ? successful hunts after the first ? increase their attack range by ?.<br /><br /><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">Attack Range</span> bonus = <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">?</span><br /><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">Dance of Arrows</span> bonus Attack Speed = <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">?%</span><br /><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">Wolf's Frenzy</span> bonus Current Health Damage = <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">?%</span><br /><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">Mounting Dread</span> bonus Missing Health Damage = <span style=\"color: #FFF673\">?%</span></span>",
        "iconFile": "Kindred_Passive.png",
